From 77ce48c64d32a721bbc9127f99fe2f12575f9cdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kamlesh Gurudasani <kamlesh@ti.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:55:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] xtest: pkcs11: add ML-DSA and ML-KEM regression cases

Add pkcs11_1100_pqc.c with regression cases for the PKCS#11 v3.2
post-quantum mechanisms:

  1100  ML-DSA-65
  1101  ML-KEM-768
  1102  ML-DSA-87
  1103  ML-DSA-44
  1104  ML-KEM-512
  1105  ML-KEM-1024

The ML-DSA cases generate a key pair, sign, verify and check that a
tampered signature is rejected. The ML-KEM cases generate a key pair,
encapsulate, decapsulate and check that both sides derive the same
secret. The file is built when CFG_PKCS11_TA=y and needs a PKCS#11 TA
built with CFG_PKCS11_TA_ML_DSA=y and CFG_PKCS11_TA_ML_KEM=y.

Tested: xtest -t pkcs11 passes with no failures on an AM62Lx EVM.

Signed-off-by: Kamlesh Gurudasani <kamlesh@ti.com>
